#, kde-format
msgid "Math macros:"
msgstr "Matematikmakroer:"

#: src/configpage.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \\newcommand lines written here are available in the formulas of every "
"document."
msgstr ""
"De \\newcommand-linjer, der skrives her, er tilgængelige i formlerne i alle "
"dokumenter."

